    <status>
      <progress>Complete</progress>
      <update>CBRS maps are either enacted by Congress through legislation or adopted administratively by the Service, and are also maintained by the Service. As maps are revised, this data set will be updated with an updated buffer for the revised boundaries.</update>
    </status>
