      <procstep>
        <procdesc>These buffers are generated from the polyline feature class (CBRS_Boundaries) used to create the official maps.  The offshore and coincident boundaries do not have a buffer associated with them (see completeness report). </procdesc>
        <procdate>Unknown</procdate>
      </procstep>
      <procstep>
        <procdesc>Adjacent buffer polygons were merged to remove overlaps.</procdesc>
        <procdate>Unknown</procdate>
      </procstep>
