  <attrlabl>BUFF_DIST</attrlabl><attrdef>The horizontal distance in feet from both the inside and outside edge of the buffer polygon to the boundary of the CBRS polygon it follows. All coordinates falling within a buffer polygon are less than the value of Buff_Dist in feet from the boundary of a CBRS polygon</attrdef><attrdefs>U.S. Fish and Wildlife Service</attrdefs><attrdomv>
